# MACHINE-SPECIFIC - delete this file if your repo path has no "&" in it.
#
# cmd.exe treats "&" as a command separator, so npm's default script shim fails
# with "'D' is not recognized" when the repo lives under a path like "R&D -Code".
# Pointing script-shell at Git bash sidesteps it.
#
# The path below is absolute and Windows-only. On macOS/Linux, or on Windows
# without Git for Windows installed here, npm cannot spawn the shell and every
# "npm run" fails. Delete this file in that case - it is not otherwise needed.
script-shell=C:\Program Files\Git\bin\bash.exe
